# Store and check out every text file with LF line endings, on every machine.
# Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf) warns "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on each commit and files end up
# with mixed endings, which agents then have to be told to preserve file by file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
